   - `*` matches zero or more characters of a name segment WITHOUT crossing directory boundaries → `[^/]*`. ✓ matches Dart.
   - `**` matches characters crossing directory boundaries → `.*`. ✓
   - `?` one character without crossing boundary → `[^/]`. ✓
   - `[...]` character class. In Java globs, `[!...]` negates. ✓
   - `{...}` alternation. ✓
